      "block_content": "6. Before the expiry of the agreed Term, subject to the agreement of both parties, this rent agreement can be extended in writing for another period of 11 months, or any other period as agreed, at enhanced rent of up to 10 % of the last \u201cRent\u201d paid by the Tenant.",
