      "block_content": "7. THAT THE TENANT SHALL USE THE SAID PREMISES ONLY FOR RESIDENTIAL PURPOSES OF SELF AND DEPENDENT FAMILY AND NOT FOR ANY OTHER PURPOSES. The tenant will be fully liable for payment of any penalty / consequential liability imposed by any authority for un-authorised use of property.",
