      "block_content": "12. That the Agreement may be terminated earlier by either side giving one month's advance notice in writing to the other party. In the event of such termination, the Tenant will hand over Vacant possession of the Premises on or before the end of notice period as provided in paras above. A notice served by email will be treated as valid.",
